<% content_for :title, 'Commission preview' %>
<div class="space-y-6">
  <section><h1 class="page-title">Commission preview</h1><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-mocha">Estimate 1% for each person working at the time of a sale, including overlapping shifts. The percentage is never divided between workers. This preview does not finalize payroll or send payments.</p></section>
  <%= form_with url: commission_preview_time_clock_path, method: :get, class: 'card card-pad grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-5' do %>
    <div><%= label_tag :start_date, 'From', class: 'block text-sm mb-1' %><%= date_field_tag :start_date, @start_date, required: true, class: 'input' %></div><div><%= label_tag :end_date, 'Through', class: 'block text-sm mb-1' %><%= date_field_tag :end_date, @end_date, required: true, class: 'input' %></div><div><%= label_tag :source, 'Sales source', class: 'block text-sm mb-1' %><%= select_tag :source, options_for_select(CommissionPreview::SOURCES.map { |source| [source.capitalize, source] }, @source), class: 'input' %></div><div><%= label_tag :currency, 'Currency', class: 'block text-sm mb-1' %><%= text_field_tag :currency, @currency, required: true, maxlength: 3, class: 'input' %></div><%= submit_tag 'Preview', class: 'btn-primary self-end' %>
  <% end %>
  <section class="card card-pad space-y-2 text-sm text-mocha"><p><strong>Estimate basis:</strong> imported item unit price × quantity before order-level discounts. Separately recorded tax, shipping and tips are not added. A tax-inclusive source item price cannot be separated using the current mirror, so review the source before approving compensation.</p><p>Only paid/fulfilled orders with completed tenders covering the gross total qualify. Orders with any recorded refund, missing/invalid item prices, or no merchandise base are excluded. Matching uses the imported order occurred_at timestamp, which some connectors set to order creation time rather than payment collection. Open shifts end at preview time. A sale at clock-out is outside that shift. Each order's 1% is rounded half-up to the nearest cent per person.</p><p>Choose one source and currency, with a maximum 31-day window. Up to 5,000 orders and 1,000 overlapping shifts are supported; larger windows require narrowing. Late source changes and approved corrections recompute this estimate. Verify discounts, returns, tip treatment and the final compensation policy before payroll.</p></section>
  <% if @preview_error %><p role="alert" class="card card-pad text-rose"><%= @preview_error %></p><% end %>
  <% if @preview %>
    <p class="text-sm text-taupe"><%= @preview.eligible_orders %> eligible sales · <%= @preview.excluded_orders %> paid/fulfilled sales excluded by payment, refund or item-data checks · <%= @preview.currency %> · <%= Time.zone.name %></p>
    <div class="card overflow-x-auto"><table class="w-full text-sm"><thead class="border-b border-fog bg-haze/60"><tr><% ['Worker', 'Type', 'Matched orders', 'Eligible item base', '1% preview'].each do |label| %><th class="th" scope="col"><%= label %></th><% end %></tr></thead><tbody class="divide-y divide-fog"><% @preview.rows.each do |row| %><tr><td class="td"><%= row[:employee] %></td><td class="td"><%= row[:employment_type].humanize %></td><td class="td"><%= row[:order_count] %></td><td class="td"><%= @preview.currency %> <%= number_with_precision(row[:sales_cents] / 100.0, precision: 2) %></td><td class="td font-semibold"><%= @preview.currency %> <%= number_with_precision(row[:commission_cents] / 100.0, precision: 2) %></td></tr><% end %><% if @preview.rows.empty? %><tr><td colspan="5" class="td text-taupe">No worker shifts overlap this window.</td></tr><% end %></tbody></table></div>
  <% end %>
  <%= link_to 'Back to time clock', time_clock_path, class: 'btn-ghost' %>
</div>
